ant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUZUKI, SHINICHI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SANO MASASHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SUZUKI NOBUAKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SUZUKI SHINICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SANO, MASASHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUZUKI, NOBUAKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUZUKI, SHINICHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A semiconductor device (A) comprises a semiconductor chip (3), a protective package (4) covering the semiconductor chip (3), a first lead (1), and a second lead (2). The semiconductor chip (3) is placed on an inner end (10a) of the first lead (1). The semiconductor chip (3) is connected through wire (W) with an inner end (20a) of the second lead (2). The first lead (1) includes an outer part (11) projecting from the protective package (4), and the second lead (2) includes an outer part (21) projecting from the protection package (4). The two outer parts (11, 21) are flat.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention porte sur un dispositif (A) à semi-conducteurs comprenant une puce (3) à semi-conducteurs, un boîtier (4) de protection recouvrant la puce (3), un premier conducteur (1) et un second conducteur (2). La puce&lt; &gt;(3) est placée sur une extrémité (10a) interne du premier conducteur (1), et est raccordée par un fil (W) à une extrémité (20a) interne du second conducteur (2). Le premier conducteur (1) comporte une partie (11) externe faisant saillie du boîtier (4) de protection, et le second conducteur (2) comporte une partie (21) externe faisant également saillie du boîtier (4). Le deux parties (11, 21) externes sont plates.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>